{"id":"77zzyzj","title":"ePOD System Structure","titleAuto":false,"color":"#5a7d3a","rootId":"rx6733u","nodes":{"rx6733u":{"id":"rx6733u","text":"ePOD System","parent":null,"side":"root","x":0,"y":0,"hlevel":1,"color":"#fff","updated":1795369948150,"w":168.63307138844155,"h":49.6223894106489},"p4nw4g8":{"id":"p4nw4g8","text":"Master Data","parent":"rx6733u","side":"right","x":238.63307138844155,"y":-88.00652942424345,"color":"#d8e0fb","created":1795369952001,"updated":1795369971596,"w":118.684955207563,"h":39.90886206478396},"ri760nc":{"id":"ri760nc","text":"Customers","parent":"p4nw4g8","side":"right","x":427.31802659600453,"y":-180.8698225214194,"color":"#ffedc2","created":1795369975249,"updated":1795369977871,"w":109.62249546996513,"h":39.90886206478396},"gppdbuo":{"id":"gppdbuo","text":"Sites","parent":"p4nw4g8","side":"right","x":427.31802659600453,"y":-118.96096045663543,"notes":"<li>Consider one-to-many scenario, e.g. store site once and allocate to multiple customers. Benefit is reduced data for duplicate sites under different customers. UI/UX would need to be extremely clear when updating things like email addresses, to make sure they know it may impact more than 1 customer.</li><li>If doing the above, for customers that only ever have a one-to-one relationship, we could prefix all unique site references with the CustomerCode (e.g. via the API)</li>","color":"#ffedc2","created":1795370457900,"updated":1795370460588,"w":67.36986720185813,"h":39.90886206478396},"zs3s043":{"id":"zs3s043","text":"Items","parent":"p4nw4g8","side":"right","x":427.31802659600453,"y":-57.05209839185147,"notes":"<li>Potentially store pricing here against Item, so it can be calculated during job creation etc if not known by other system at creation time.</li>","color":"#ffedc2","created":1795372124531,"updated":1795372132353,"w":71.58887792715494,"h":39.90886206478396},"6dzypd9":{"id":"6dzypd9","text":"Depots","parent":"p4nw4g8","side":"right","x":427.31802659600453,"y":4.8567636729324875,"color":"#e9e2d6","created":1795372968549,"updated":1795372971141,"w":82.55243964360498,"h":39.90886206478396},"siohvr0":{"id":"siohvr0","text":"Job Structure","parent":"rx6733u","side":"right","x":238.63307138844155,"y":97.72005677010843,"color":"#ffe2d6","created":1795370714032,"updated":1795370721926,"w":126.96628818811725,"h":39.90886206478396},"qhkpprz":{"id":"qhkpprz","text":"Stages","parent":"siohvr0","side":"right","x":435.5993595765588,"y":97.72005677010843,"color":"#efd9f2","created":1795370747839,"updated":1795370759315,"w":80.79451850806466,"h":39.90886206478396},"zw3jvwo":{"id":"zw3jvwo","text":"Items","parent":"qhkpprz","side":"right","x":586.3938780846235,"y":66.76562573771645,"notes":"<li>Store items under stages to allow multi-collect, multi-deliver stages. E.g. collect 10 items at first collection, then 2 more stages each delivering 5 items. Storing items at \"Job\" level doesn't allow this</li><li>Consider nesting \"Items\", e.g. top level item is \"Pallets\" then lower level items are the individual product lines. Calidus did this well from memory (Ask Matt T). </li><li>Consider nested items being optionally hidden to driver, e.g. driver may be delivering \"Pallets\" without knowledge of what is in them, but the customer requires a POD for the products rather than the \"Pallets\"</li>","color":"#cfe9e6","created":1795370833153,"updated":1795370834566,"w":71.58887792715494,"h":39.90886206478396},"0x65npx":{"id":"0x65npx","text":"Stage Types","parent":"qhkpprz","side":"right","x":586.3938780846235,"y":128.6744878025004,"notes":"E.g.\n<ul><li>Collect</li><li>Deliver</li><li>Trunk</li><li>Changeover</li></ul>Certain \"Types\" may carry restrictions or configuration, e.g. a \"Trunk\" stage may not need the user to indicate items against them, as the action is implied by goods already on the vehicle.\nProcess could go:\n<ul><li>Collect 10 items</li><li>Deliver 5 items</li><li>Trunk 5 items (implied by only 5 left on Vehicle)</li><li>Deliver 5 items</li></ul>","color":"#ffe2d6","created":1795371151181,"updated":1795371165212,"w":118.95858113184359,"h":39.90886206478396},"br6wc7m":{"id":"br6wc7m","text":"Manifest Structure","parent":"rx6733u","side":"right","x":238.63307138844155,"y":190.58334986728437,"w":166.3803851824813,"h":39.90886206478396},"43vl6k4":{"id":"43vl6k4","text":"Planning","parent":"rx6733u","side":"left","x":-163.41179966815693,"y":-324.9349484587948,"color":"#dcefce","created":1795372423258,"updated":1795372427890,"w":93.41179966815693,"h":39.90886206478396},"eixh3k8":{"id":"eixh3k8","text":"Allocated Orders","parent":"43vl6k4","side":"left","x":-384.6099983410836,"y":-551.7396424686802,"color":"#ffedc2","created":1795372429491,"updated":1795372455829,"w":151.19819867292665,"h":39.90886206478396},"7f40j3w":{"id":"7f40j3w","text":"Card View","parent":"eixh3k8","side":"left","x":-558.4512295716647,"y":-644.6029355658562,"color":"#cfe9e6","created":1795372476603,"updated":1795372480113,"w":103.8412312305811,"h":39.90886206478396},"jvtzcps":{"id":"jvtzcps","text":"Gannt View","parent":"eixh3k8","side":"left","x":-567.5136893092626,"y":-582.6940735010722,"color":"#cfe9e6","created":1795372481534,"updated":1795372498140,"w":112.90369096817896,"h":39.90886206478396},"hfn6596":{"id":"hfn6596","text":"Table View","parent":"eixh3k8","side":"left","x":-561.9539501482101,"y":-520.7852114362883,"color":"#cfe9e6","created":1795372510126,"updated":1795372516240,"w":107.34395180712646,"h":39.90886206478396},"j7en9xj":{"id":"j7en9xj","text":"Map View","parent":"eixh3k8","side":"left","x":-555.8994459167377,"y":-458.87634937150426,"color":"#cfe9e6","created":1795372533535,"updated":1795372537477,"w":101.28944757565405,"h":39.90886206478396},"72orpcl":{"id":"72orpcl","text":"Unallocated Orders","parent":"43vl6k4","side":"left","x":-402.8649769650558,"y":-304.10419420954446,"color":"#e9e2d6","created":1795372457469,"updated":1795372465630,"w":169.4531772968989,"h":39.90886206478396},"hs3eelw":{"id":"hs3eelw","text":"Card View","parent":"72orpcl","side":"left","x":-576.7062081956369,"y":-396.9674873067204,"color":"#d8e0fb","created":1795372552488,"updated":1795372556278,"w":103.8412312305811,"h":39.90886206478396},"35sr0m6":{"id":"35sr0m6","text":"Gannt View","parent":"72orpcl","side":"left","x":-585.7686679332347,"y":-335.0586252419364,"color":"#d8e0fb","created":1795372557629,"updated":1795372563958,"w":112.90369096817896,"h":39.90886206478396},"1s4sjk7":{"id":"1s4sjk7","text":"Table View","parent":"72orpcl","side":"left","x":-580.2089287721823,"y":-273.1497631771524,"color":"#d8e0fb","created":1795372564425,"updated":1795372571452,"w":107.34395180712646,"h":39.90886206478396},"bva2wrz":{"id":"bva2wrz","text":"Map View","parent":"72orpcl","side":"left","x":-574.1544245407099,"y":-211.24090111236845,"color":"#d8e0fb","created":1795372571632,"updated":1795372573489,"w":101.28944757565405,"h":39.90886206478396},"j9r9egu":{"id":"j9r9egu","text":"Optimisation","parent":"43vl6k4","side":"left","x":-356.3937239038442,"y":-77.29950019965891,"notes":"All optimisations will require a configurable mapping system, whereby data in the system can be transformed/pivoted in to the optimisers format based on pre-agreed rules and logic.","color":"#dcefce","created":1795372594858,"updated":1795372601143,"w":122.98192423568729,"h":39.90886206478396},"d736u0m":{"id":"d736u0m","text":"Automated - Black Box","parent":"j9r9egu","side":"left","x":-618.8808781609164,"y":-149.33203904758454,"notes":"Potentially via Webhook whenever a job is added or critical things are amended (e.g. Addresses, quantities, timings, dates etc.)","color":"#ffe2d6","created":1795372602813,"updated":1795372615343,"w":192.48715425707223,"h":39.90886206478396},"1pn399d":{"id":"1pn399d","text":"Semi-automated - User triggered","parent":"j9r9egu","side":"left","x":-666.3941481411091,"y":-87.42317698280058,"notes":"User sends data out to optimiser at a specific time, e.g. an agreed cutoff time when all volume is ready.","color":"#cfe9e6","created":1795372658409,"updated":1795372671800,"w":240.00042423726495,"h":60.1562156310673},"nkn8ynd":{"id":"nkn8ynd","text":"Single route optimisation","parent":"j9r9egu","side":"left","x":-637.0189193306475,"y":-5.266961351733286,"notes":"Where orders are already planned, but the sequence of the Stages can be optimised based on the quantities & timings.","color":"#cfe9e6","created":1795372673619,"updated":1795372687498,"w":210.6251954268033,"h":39.90886206478396},"0iu2zvz":{"id":"0iu2zvz","text":"System Fundamentals","parent":"rx6733u","side":"left","x":-261.1460398891244,"y":324.52475077999384,"color":"#efd9f2","created":1795373061123,"updated":1795373067918,"w":191.14603988912435,"h":39.90886206478396},"cdw3r1e":{"id":"cdw3r1e","text":"Users","parent":"0iu2zvz","side":"left","x":-404.2713138734881,"y":56.64190071305063,"color":"#d8e0fb","created":1795373069925,"updated":1795373075034,"w":73.12527398436374,"h":39.90886206478396},"tn2mt93":{"id":"tn2mt93","text":"Permissions","parent":"0iu2zvz","side":"left","x":-450.6125077859232,"y":118.55076277783459,"color":"#cfe9e6","created":1795373075572,"updated":1795373078498,"w":119.46646789679882,"h":39.90886206478396},"l2a2js6":{"id":"l2a2js6","text":"API","parent":"0iu2zvz","side":"left","x":-386.39377693350235,"y":180.45962484261855,"color":"#dcefce","created":1795373078903,"updated":1795373091896,"w":55.247737044377985,"h":39.90886206478396},"nwt4zyq":{"id":"nwt4zyq","text":"Tab Switching","parent":"0iu2zvz","side":"left","x":-462.12293541874226,"y":242.3684869074025,"notes":"Ability to have multiple jobs/manifests etc open at the same time and easily flick between them.","color":"#efd9f2","created":1795373092393,"updated":1795373105120,"w":130.97689552961785,"h":39.90886206478396},"44ymp95":{"id":"44ymp95","text":"Tabbed Entities UI","parent":"0iu2zvz","side":"left","x":-490.8077315373308,"y":304.2773489721865,"notes":"When viewing a record in the system, have a tab for child entities.\nE.g.\n<ul><